[B]Mire Sirens v1.0.2[/B]
[I]Trakt Watched-Sync & In-Progress Pagination Fix[/I]

Fixes Trakt sync breaking due to a Trakt API change:
- Trakt now enforces pagination on watched movies/shows AND playback progress (Continue Watching / in-progress) endpoints, silently capping results to the most recent ~100/25 items
- Added full pagination support (get_trakt_all_pages) across all three sync calls so complete watched history and in-progress items sync correctly again
- Updated the shows-watched query from extended=full to extended=progress to match Trakt's current API structure

Fix adapted from a community patch for FLAM 2.2.04 (credit: ReaLx3m).

