[B]Mire Sirens v1.0.1[/B]
[I]TV Menu & Calendar Fix[/I]

- Fixed Trending, Trending Recent, Popular, and Popular Today returning empty for TV shows — caused by TMDB returning null external_ids, which crashed metadata parsing silently for every item
- Fixed Trakt Calendar erroring out on shows with null season/episode data; calendar building is now hardened with per-item error handling so one bad entry doesn't break the whole list

